    "breadcrumb": "Podpora Swing Catalyst \u003e Kamery a Video",
    "content": "Jak provést aktualizaci firmwaru na FLIR Blackfly S. Tento článek popisuje, jak upgradovat firmware na FLIR Blackfly S GigE BFS-PGE-04S2C-CS.\nUpozornění: Nepokračujte v upgradu firmwaru, pokud se model produktu kamery neshoduje s: BFS-PGE-04S2C-CS Požadavky: Spinaker SpinView software (see flir-blackfly-gige-setup.md) for details.\nFLIR Blackfly S BFS-PGE-04S2C-CS camera.\nDownload the firmware update, double click on the zip file and extract the ez2 file by clicking Extract all.\nStart SpinView (Windows Start Menu, type SpinView), click Spinview icon.\nRight click the camera you wish to update and click: Update Device Firmware.\nDownload the firmware file if you haven’t already:\nhttps://cloudfront.swingcatalyst.com/files/bfs_ge_imx287_2005.0000.066.000.zip \u0026 extract the zip file.\nSelect the firmware file that you have downloaded.\nClick Start and then click Yes\nLink to old firmware: https://cloudfront.swingcatalyst.com/files/bfs_ge_imx287.zip\nLast updated: 2021-06-16 | View on official support site",
